4\/23-24-Yearbook.jpg\" class=\"attachment-us_350_350_crop size-us_350_350_crop wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a><\/div><div class=\"w-vwrapper usg_vwrapper_1 align_left valign_top \"><h2 class=\"w-post-elm post_title usg_post_title_1 entry-title color_link_inherit\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/2024\/04\/25\/2023-2024-scs-yearbook-available-to-order\/\">2023-2024 SCS Yearbook Available to Order<\/a><\/h2><div class=\"w-hwrapper usg_hwrapper_2 align_left valign_top wrap \"><time class=\"w-post-elm post_date usg_post_date_1 entry-date published\" datetime=\"2024-04-25T08:08:36-07:00\"><i class=\"far fa-clock\"><\/i>April 25, 2024<\/time><div class=\"w-post-elm post_author usg_post_author_1 color_link_inherit vcard author\"><i class=\"far fa-user\"><\/i><div class=\"post-author-meta\"><a class=\"post-author-name fn\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/author\/cmcleod\/\">Cheryl McLeod<\/a><\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"w-post-elm post_taxonomy usg_post_taxonomy_2 style_simple color_link_inherit\"><i class=\"far fa-folder-open\"><\/i><a href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/category\/announcements\/\">Announcements<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"w-post-elm post_content usg_post_content_1\">The 2023-2024 SCS Yearbook is available to order! Pre-order now until May 16th.\u00a0Pre-orders will be shipped to the school, you can still order a\u00a0yearbook\u00a0after May 16th for shipping to your&hellip;<\/div><a class=\"w-btn us-btn-style_2 usg_btn_1\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/2024\/04\/25\/2023-2024-scs-yearbook-available-to-order\/\"><span class=\"w-btn-label\">Read More<\/span><\/a><\/div><\/div>\t<\/div>\r\n<\/article>\r\n<article class=\"w-grid-item ratio_1x1 size_1x1 post-10712 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\" data-id=\"10712\">\r\n\t<div class=\"w-grid-item-h\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"w-hwrapper usg_hwrapper_1 align_left valign_top responsive\"><div cl